pf-r-eh pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-245_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-campCi hhsVXy pf-246_"><strong>SPREADER / SPRAYERS&nbsp;•&nbsp;AERATORS&nbsp;• BLOWERS&nbsp;• TRUCK LOADERS</strong></h3><p class="sc-flBjcR dOMEqt pf-248_ pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Whether you're a homeowner who takes their turf seriously or a pro looking to expand service offerings, you can make an even bigger impact with the Scag line of debris and turf management equipment. Designed for fertilizer and weed control applications, lawn aeration, debris clean-up and more, these machines are built to deliver high-grade performance and long-term dependability.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-ktJcvw lknomy pf-251_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:8px;--s-sm:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-252_"><img alt="Scag-TurfStorm.jpg__PID:083a0e84-cabf-4b70-a6a9-4895176dcebf" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-TurfStorm.jpg?v=1788451635&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1" width="1000" height="1000" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-cezzpg gsScCn pf-253_" store="[object Object]"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-campCi hhsVXy pf-254_"><strong>Turf Storm&nbsp;&amp; XL</strong></h3><p class="sc-flBjcR dOMEqt pf-256_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">The Turf Storm XL and Turf Storm are ready to help you handle any job. With a 220-lb spreader capacity, 60-gallon sprayer capacity and an 8-ft spray boom, the Turf Storm XL can handle even the largest jobs. Conversely, the Turf Storm, with its 120-lb spreader capacity and 30-gallon sprayer capacity, is ideal for working on smaller residential properties. And, its 35.5-inch width (65-inch boom folded in) lets it fit through any standard gate.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-259_"><img alt="Scag-Aerstorm.jpg__PID:e06d82ca-bbd4-4f6e-9385-6b9db2050d20" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Aerstorm.jpg?v=1788451812&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Aerstorm.jpg?v=1788451812&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Aerstorm.jpg?v=1788451812&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Aerstorm.jpg?v=1788451812&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Aerstorm.jpg?v=1788451812&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/file