mePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-ExtremePro.jpg?v=1788452440&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1" width="1000" height="1000" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-cezzpg gsScCn pf-275_" store="[object Object]"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-campCi hhsVXy pf-276_"><strong>Extreme Pro</strong></h3><p class="sc-flBjcR dOMEqt pf-278_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">With incredible ground-clearing force, nothing gets in the way of the Extreme Pro Blower and its massive air output of up to 2,824 CFM. Heavy-duty construction ensures years of dependable service and worry-free performance, and its 17″ steel, 6-blade impeller is dynamically balanced for smooth operation.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-281_"><img alt="Scag-Extreme.jpg__PID:96273e68-7ff6-4365-88c3-4befce3321f3" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Extreme_e642cf50-ddbf-4d1b-adf1-b62d45434db