aves and other debris exactly where you need them to go.</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-288_"><img alt="Scag-Classic.jpg__PID:05788019-7a11-4f52-a139-57c1a7275b99" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Scag-Classic.jpg?v=1788452700&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1" width="1000" height="1000" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-cezzpg gsScCn pf-289_" store="[object Object]"/><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-campCi hhsVXy pf-290_"><strong>Classic</strong></h3><p class="sc-flBjcR dOMEqt pf-292_" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">Ready to roll when you are, the Classic Blower clears leaves and other debris away with ease and efficiency. With large pneumatic rear tires for easy rolling, this nimble and powerful machine is ready to roll when yo