cag product line is constantly evolving to meet the changing demands of your work:<br><br>• Stand-On Aerator: AerStorm<br>• Stand-On Spreader/Sprayer: TurfStorm<br>• Stand-On Blower: Windstorm<br>• Wheeled Blowers: Extreme Pro, Extreme, Classic<br>• Debris Truck Loaders:&nbsp;Tow-Behind,&nbsp;Skid-Mount<br>• Stand-On Mowers: V-Ride II, V-Ride XL<br>• Zero-Turn Riding Mowers: Turf Tiger II,&nbsp;Cheeetah II,&nbsp;Tiger Cat II,&nbsp;Patriot,
Freedom Z,&nbsp;Liberty Z<br>• Electric Riding&nbsp;Mower: EVZ<br>• Walk-Behind Mowers: SWZ, Hydro-Drive, SW Belt-Drive, SWZT Hydro-Drive, SFC-30, SFC-21</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-361_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/SCAG_2024_ProductCatalog_spread_riding-mower.jpg?v=1710264423" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/SCAG_2024_ProductCatalog_spread_riding-mower.jpg?v=1710264423 1536w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/SCAG_2024_ProductCatalog_spread_riding-mower_500x.jpg?v=1710264423 320w" width="853" height="1091" alt="SCAG_2024_ProductCatalog_spread_riding-mower.jpg__PID:f5476ba8-b662-46cc-a00d-e2a0adb1f2bf" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-dUYKzm kaeuCi pf-362_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-3322" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-ijDPxU jIOUVD pf-363_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-lfYA-dV jRSTjo"><div class="sc-ktJcvw lknomy pf-364_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-365_"><div data-pf-type="Divider2" class="sc-deXguC jxXmXS pf-366_ pf-divider-2"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-e316" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-ijDPxU jIOUVD pf-370_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-lfYA-dV jRSTjo"><div class="sc-ktJcvw lknomy pf-371_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-372_"><div data-pf-type="Youtube" class="sc-gwZLmR ciKvMT pf-373_"><div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;border-radius:inh