-scheme-1 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-lfYA-dV jRSTjo"><div class="sc-ktJcvw lknomy pf-387_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-388_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-campCi hhsVXy pf-389_ pf-heading-6-h3">Ride-On Zero Turn Mowers </h3><p class="sc-jNwNJu KfQqr pf-391_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Productive drive speed, unmatched quality-of-cut, turn-on-a-dime maneuverability! Scag zero-turn mowers have it all. Designed and engineered with precision, crafted with the best materials and manufactured to the highest standards, these durable, high-performance machines are ready to get the job done.<br><br><b>Keep a real-time "eye" on important system functions.</b> Depending on the mower model and engine selection, the Tiger Eye™ Advanced Monitoring System monitors a wide variety of systems in real-time, giving you valuable information in just a glance, right from the operator’s seat.</p><ul style="--pf-line-spacing-xs:10px;--pf-line-spacing-sm:10px;--pf-line-spacing-md:10px;--pf-line-spacing-lg:10px;--pf-text-indent-xs:0px;--pf-text-indent-sm:0px;--pf-text-indent-md:0px;--pf-text-indent-lg:0px" data-pf-type="List2" class="sc-lgjIEp jtQYFs pf-393_"><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fatbYi ecqLMT pf-394_ pf-text-1">Turf Tiger II - 51", 61", or 72" Cutting Width</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fatbYi ecqLMT pf-396_ pf-text-1">Cheeetah II - &nbsp;61"&nbsp;or 72" Cutting Width</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fatbYi ecqLMT pf-398_ pf-text-1">Tiger Cat&nbsp;II - &nbsp;48", 52", or 61" Cutting Width</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fatbYi ecqLMT pf-400_ pf-text-1">Patriot&nbsp;- 52"&nbsp;or 61" Cutting Width</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fatbYi ecqLMT pf-402_ pf-text-1">Freedom Z&nbsp;- 48"&nbsp;or 52" Cutting Width</li><li data-pf-type="List2.Item2" class="sc-fatbYi ecqLMT pf-404_ pf-text-1">Liberty Z&nbsp;- 36", 42", 48", 52", or 61" Cutting Width</li></ul><a href="/collections/lawn-mowers?filter.p.product_type=Riding+Mower&filter.p.vendor=SCAG" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-leXARK cSddeU pf-406_ pf-button-2">View Riding Mowers</a></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-408_"><div data-pf-type="Youtube" class="sc-gwZLmR ciKvMT pf-409_"><div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;border-radius:inherit"><iframe class="pf-ifr" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/a0MCGx6eik4?start=0&autoplay=0&loop=0&mute=0&controls=0&enablejsapi=1" allowfullscreen="" width="560" height="315" allow="autoplay" title="yt-video" style="border-radius:inherit"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-a3a0" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-ijDPxU jIOUVD pf-410_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-lfYA-dV jRSTjo"><div class="sc-ktJcvw lknomy pf-411_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-412_"><div data-pf-type="Youtube" class="sc-gwZLmR ciKvMT pf-413_"><div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;border-radius:inherit"><iframe class="pf-ifr" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gx5qZ2TzdPI?start=0&autoplay=0&loop=0&mute=0&controls=0&enablejsapi=1" allowfullscreen="" width="560" height="315" allow="autoplay" title="yt-video" style="border-radius:inherit"></iframe></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-izQAGL gWOaKl pf-414_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-campCi hhsVXy pf-415_ pf-heading-6-h3">Electric&nbsp;Mower</h3><p class="sc-jNwNJu KfQqr pf-417_